The '''Glowstick Guys''' (ペンライトなヤツ, ''Penraitona Yatsu'', '''Penlight Guys''') are a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appear in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Glowstick Guys
|image = E 398.png
|appearance = [[Crazed Moneko]]<br>
[[Sponsorship BitSummit Memorial!|協賛BitSummit記念!]]<br>
[[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event|Hatsune Miku Collaboration]]<br>
[[Citadel#Traitless|Traitless Citadel]]
|money drop = 1¢ - 4¢
}}

==Enemy==
They are a small crowd of 3 stick figures with glowsticks and neon colored bandanas. Each one has a unique color: purple for the front one, green for the middle one, and light blue for the last one. They are extremely weak, with only 1 health and 1 attack power.

Much like [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] and [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]], this enemy serves as a decoration, due to them being helpful for neither the enemy side (in terms of stats) nor the player's side (they don't help the player with money). They are typically spammed at a moderate rate in the stages that they appear in, but higher-than-usual enemy limits prevent them from clogging the enemy spawn system.

==Strategy==
As mentioned above, this enemy poses essentially no threat, as they have pitiful stats all around. However, they can be a nuisance for [[:Category:Single Attack Cats|Single Target Cats]] without access to [[Wave Attack]]s or [[Surge Attack]]s. They can also be used as a, albeit one-time, stepping stone for cats like [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]].

