==Trivia==
*After being contacted about this enemy's official name, [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] revealed it to be ペンライトなヤツ (Penlight Guys)<ref>https://seesaawiki.jp/battlecatswiki/d/%a5%da%a5%f3%a5%e9%a5%a4%a5%c8%a4%ca%a5%e4%a5%c4</ref>, about four years before it was revealed in-game with the release of [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].
*They are tied with [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] and [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] for the lowest health in the game.

